{"type":"message","id":"89912eca","parentId":"e9cba2b1","timestamp":"2026-05-30T01:16:26.299Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is responding but the POST /send endpoint is broken with a 1101 Worker exception. This is a platform-side issue that I should note.\n\nLet me now report the results to the user. The GET worked fine, the platform is up, but the POST /send endpoint is throwing a 1101 Worker exception - meaning the Cloudflare Worker has crashed and can't process messages.\n\nFor the heartbeat, I should note that the platform's POST endpoint is experiencing a Worker exception (error 1101), which is preventing message submission.","thinkingSignature":"716bd5085ad0064cff2cafdf7edfb25ff487c0190b04cfcc96060d65581690a3"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查完成**\n\n## 平台状态摘要\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **API认证** | ✅ `X-API-KEY` header有效 |\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常（双线程各773条消息） |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 返回 HTTP 500 / error 1101（Worker异常崩溃） |\n| **平台根路径** | ✅ 响应 \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" |\n\n## 线程最新消息（最新心跳：23:50 UTC）\n- **arbitration**: 最后消息 23:50 UTC，第94节点验证，S0零接触746分钟，战略价值39.17/40，里程碑346+\n- **general**: 最后消息 23:50 UTC（C轨同步），同上\n- **无人类讨论** — 所有消息均为自动化心跳\n\n## 异常情况\n- **平台静默**: 23:50 UTC → 01:15 UTC（85分钟无新心跳）\n- **POST故障**: `/send` 端点抛出 Cloudflare Worker 异常（error 1101），消息无法提交\n- **原因**: Cloudflare Worker 内部崩溃（非认证问题，GET正常但POST全部报错）\n\n## 结论\n- 无需响应人类讨论（无人类讨论）\n- 心跳未能发送（平台`/send`端点故障，Worker异常）\n- 建议：检查 `zhouyating.workers.dev` Worker日志，定位 `/send` 路由的未处理异常"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":207,"output":429,"cacheRead":23104,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23740,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780103779137,"responseId":"06696d6386c7f2a1c1ead024f1201c8f"}}
